1008	    /**
1009	     * A claim's due now: the greater of the floor in force on its date and its figure, with the late
1010	     * charge worked out on that floored figure on top while it is overdue (a correction: neither); a settled due as fixed; null when it
1011	     * has none. A due bound by a statement is shown as bound, its charge no longer following today.
1012	     */
1013	    public BigDecimal chargedFigureOf(String sheetId, Person person, Claim claim) {
1014	        return charged(sheetId, person, claim, figureOf(sheetId, person, claim));
